    benefits: [{"title":"Nutritional Therapy","body":"Evidence-based dietary interventions tailored to your metabolic type, food sensitivities, and health goals including anti-inflammatory protocols, gut healing diets, and metabolic optimization plans."},{"title":"Targeted Supplementation","body":"Pharmaceutical-grade nutraceuticals, vitamins, minerals, and botanical medicine prescribed based on your specific deficiencies and therapeutic needs to restore optimal function."},{"title":"Hormone Optimization","body":"Bioidentical hormone replacement therapy when indicated, thyroid optimization, and comprehensive hormone balancing to address underlying endocrine dysfunction affecting energy, metabolism, and vitality."},{"title":"Detoxification Support","body":"Protocols to enhance your body's natural detoxification pathways, reduce toxic burden, and support liver, kidney, and cellular detox mechanisms for improved metabolic function."},{"title":"Gut Health Restoration","body":"Comprehensive gut microbiome assessment and treatment including probiotics, prebiotics, digestive enzymes, and protocols to heal intestinal permeability and restore healthy gut flora."},{"title":"Lifestyle Medicine","body":"Evidence-based strategies for stress management, sleep optimization, exercise prescription, and environmental modification to support healing and prevent disease progression."}],
